"When enabled, clicking on calendar events will open the selected third-party calendar app instead of Apple Calendar." = "启用后，点击日历事件将打开选定的第三方日历应用程序，而不是 Apple 日历。";
"When enabled, stats monitoring stops a few seconds after the notch closes." = "启用后，刘海关闭几秒后统计监控将停止。";
"When enabled, the Stats tab will display real-time system performance graphs. This feature requires system permissions and may use additional battery." = "启用后，统计标签页将显示实时系统性能图表。此功能需要系统权限，可能会消耗额外电量。";
"When enabled, the Stats tab will display real-time system performance graphs. This feature requires system permissions and may use additional battery. Enabling LLM Usage Monitor adds a Usage tab that tracks token usage and spend across your configured AI providers." = "启用后，“统计”标签页会显示实时系统性能图表。此功能需要系统权限，并可能增加耗电量。启用 LLM 用量监控会添加一个“用量”标签页，用于跟踪已配置的各 AI 提供商的 token 用量和费用。";
"When enabled, the music visualizer displays real-time audio spectrum data synced to your music. Requires macOS 14.2+ and uses minimal CPU/GPU resources via the Accelerate framework." = "启用时，音乐可视化将显示与音乐同步的实时音频频谱数据。需要 macOS 14.2+，通过 Accelerate 框架使用最少的 CPU/GPU 资源。";
"When enabled, the notch slides up and hides on external (non-notch) displays until you hover over it." = "启用时，刘海在外接（无刘海）显示器上会向上滑动隐藏，直到您将鼠标悬停在上方。";
